This page is an attempt to suggest brivla for various musical moods. The list is based on [http://www.allmusic.com/cg/amg.dll?p=amg&sql=75:|www.allmusic.com]. The definitions are based on [http://wordweb.info/free/|WordWeb] and [http://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Wiktionary:Main_Page|Wiktionary]. Feel free to add more than one suggestion.

||__eng__|__definition__|__jbo__|__notes__
acerbic|harsh or corrosive in tone|jursa|
aggressive|having or showing determination and energetic pursuit of your ends| |
ambigious|having a strong desire for success or achievement| |
amiable|disposed to please| |
angry|feeling or showing anger|fengu|
angst-ridden|dominated or plagued by a feeling of acute but vague anxiety or apprehension| |
atmospheric| | |
austere|of a stern or strict bearing or demeanour; forbidding in aspect| |
*|*|*|*
||

